- Contact type
- Display name
- Authorized contact channels
- Contact preferences
- Geographic reference, where relevant
- Contact classification
- Record origin
- Creation timestamp
- Last update timestamp
- Record status

Support contact types such as:

- Buyer
- Seller
- Tenant
- Landlord
- Investor
- Property owner
- General inquiry
- Business contact

Requirements:

- A CRM contact is not an authentication identity.
